@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@userId = 1
# Reutilizar transactionId solo para reintentar la misma orden. Cambiarlo para una operación nueva.
# Primera solicitud: 201. Reintento equivalente: 200 con la orden existente. Otro payload o usuario: 409.

### Búsqueda paginada de activos
GET {{baseUrl}}/instruments?query=molin&page=1&limit=2

### Portfolio antes de operar
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/portfolio

### Compra MARKET por cantidad (modifica el saldo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "instrumentId": "47",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 2
}

### Compra LIMIT por monto (reserva pesos)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
  "instrumentId": "47",
  "side": "BUY",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "price": "900.00",
  "amount": "2000.00"
}

### Venta MARKET
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
  "instrumentId": "47",
  "side": "SELL",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 1
}

### Ingreso de pesos
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
  "instrumentId": "66",
  "side": "CASH_IN",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "amount": "1000.00"
}

### Retiro de pesos
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
  "instrumentId": "66",
  "side": "CASH_OUT",
  "type": "MARKET",
  "size": 500
}

### Cancelar una orden NEW propia (reemplazar orderId por el id devuelto al crearla)
@orderId = 0
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
